Project Requirement Document (PRD)

Project Title: SymptoTrack AI – Hybrid RAG Chatbot for Symptom Monitoring 

1. Overview
SymptoTrack AI is an intelligent healthcare assistant that uses a Hybrid Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) chatbot to help users monitor their symptoms and receive health-related guidance. The system allows users to input their symptoms and receive AI-generated responses based on medical knowledge retrieved from trusted healthcare databases.

The chatbot combines AI language models with medical knowledge retrieval systems to provide reliable and contextual health information. It also enables users to track symptom history, monitor patterns, and receive preventive suggestions.

This system aims to support early health awareness and encourage users to seek medical consultation when necessary.

2. Problem Statement
Many individuals ignore or misinterpret early symptoms due to lack of medical knowledge or access to immediate healthcare advice. Searching symptoms online often results in misleading, unverified, or confusing information.

Existing symptom-checker tools often lack personalization and historical tracking. There is a need for a smart, interactive system that can monitor symptoms, provide relevant information, and track health patterns over time.

SymptoTrack AI addresses this problem by providing a reliable AI-driven symptom monitoring chatbot that retrieves verified medical information and assists users in understanding their symptoms.

